## Normative trajectories of R 1 , R 2 *, and magnetic susceptibility in basal ganglia on healthy ageing

Kwok-  Shing Chan a,b,c,d , Marcel P . Zwiers a , Michelle G. Jansen a , Martin E. Johansson a,e , Rick C. Helmich a,e , Joukje M. Oosterman a , David G. Norris a,f,g , Christian F. Beckmann a,b , José P . Marques a

